🐾 The three little pigs lived in a cozy cottage on the hill. 🏠

🐰 Pig 1 was a tiny, furry little pig. 🐰🐿️ He lived in a cozy burrow with a warm bed 🛏️. 🐰🐿️ He was always happy to sleep under the stars 🌌.

🐰 Pig 2 was a big, sturdy pig. 🐰🐾🐾 He lived in a big, cozy burrow with a warm bed 🛏️. 🐰🐾🐾 He was always happy to eat 🍅🐰🐾🐾.

🐰 Pig 3 was a medium-sized pig. 🐰🐾🐰🐾 He lived in a medium-sized burrow with a warm bed 🛏️. 🐰🐾🐰🐾 He was always happy to play 🐰🐾🐰🐾.

🐰🐾🐰🐾 They lived happily together, sharing their burrows and their dreams 🐾🐰🐾🐰🐾. 🐾🐰🐾🐰🐾

